# University Payroll System

A Java-based payroll management system for university employees featuring a Swing GUI and a MySQL backend.

## Authors
Pandelis Vasilakis** (csd5112)
Sofia Euthimiadi** (csd5394)
Paraskevi Mourelatou** (csd5149)

## Features
Employee Management:** Hire, update details,  view employee profiles.
Payroll Processing:** Calculate monthly salaries, including allowances .
Contract Management:** Track contract durations and renewal status for temporary staff.

## Requirements
 Java JDK 
 MySQL Server (8.0+)
 MySQL Connector/J (mysql-connector-j-8.0.33.jar)

## Configuration (Important)
Before compiling, please check the database credentials in src/util/DatabaseInitializer.java.
By default, the system assumes:
 URL: localhost:3306
 User:  root
 Password:  1234


### Linux - macOS / Windows

1. Compilation:

javac -cp ".:mysql-connector-j-8.0.33.jar" -d out $(find src -name "*.java")

javac -cp ".:mysql-connector-j-8.0.33.jar" -d out src/**/*.java


## Running


java -cp "out:mysql-connector-j-8.0.33.jar" Main

## Database Setup

Ensure MySQL is running and configured. The system will automatically initialize the database schema.
